#NEXUS

[ Loewen et al. 2024, PeerJ 12: e17224, Fig. 24: 50% majority-rule tree of Centrosaurinae, rectangular, root left, with skull silhouettes at the tips, coloured stratigraphic range ovals, a timescale strip and a palaeogeographic inset map; about 30 tips, numbered node circles. 30 tips. Chasmosaurinae is a collapsed clade and keeps its printed text. CPC_279 is printed on a dashed branch with a "?" from the Xenoceratops node; it is not in the matrix and is kept here as a member of that polytomy with its printed name, so drop it if the benchmark should score only solid branches. "MOR 692 Avaceratops" and "CMN 8804 Avaceratops" are Avaceratops_sp._MOR_692 and Avaceratops_sp._CMN_8804 in the matrix. Topology transcribed from the figure and checked node by node against the image (2026-10-27); topology only, no support values. Licence: CC BY 4.0; see attribution.txt. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=30;
    TAXLABELS
        Zuniceratops_christopheri
        Chasmosaurinae
        Diabloceratops_eatoni
        Machairoceratops_cronusi
        Yehuecauhceratops_mudei
        Menefeeceratops_sealeyi
        Xenoceratops_foremostensis
        CPC_279
        Crittendenceratops_krzyzanowskii
        Nasutoceratops_titusi
        Avaceratops_lammersi_type
        Avaceratops_sp._MOR_692
        Avaceratops_sp._CMN_8804
        Lokiceratops_rangiformis
        Albertaceratops_nesmoi
        Medusaceratops_lokii
        Wendiceratops_pinhornensis
        Sinoceratops_zhuchengensis
        Coronosaurus_brinkmani
        Spinops_sternbergorum
        Centrosaurus_apertus
        Styracosaurus_ovatus
        Styracosaurus_albertensis
        Stellasaurus_ancellae
        Einiosaurus_procurvicornis
        Iddesleigh_pachyrhinosaur
        Achelousaurus_horneri
        Pachyrhinosaurus_canadensis
        Pachyrhinosaurus_lakustai
        Pachyrhinosaurus_perotorum
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE loewen2024a_fig24 = [&R] (Zuniceratops_christopheri,(Chasmosaurinae,(Diabloceratops_eatoni,Machairoceratops_cronusi,(Yehuecauhceratops_mudei,Menefeeceratops_sealeyi),(Xenoceratops_foremostensis,CPC_279,(Crittendenceratops_krzyzanowskii,(Nasutoceratops_titusi,(Avaceratops_lammersi_type,Avaceratops_sp._MOR_692,Avaceratops_sp._CMN_8804))),((Lokiceratops_rangiformis,(Albertaceratops_nesmoi,Medusaceratops_lokii)),((Wendiceratops_pinhornensis,Sinoceratops_zhuchengensis),(Coronosaurus_brinkmani,Spinops_sternbergorum,Centrosaurus_apertus,((Styracosaurus_ovatus,Styracosaurus_albertensis),(Stellasaurus_ancellae,(Einiosaurus_procurvicornis,(Iddesleigh_pachyrhinosaur,Achelousaurus_horneri,(Pachyrhinosaurus_canadensis,(Pachyrhinosaurus_lakustai,Pachyrhinosaurus_perotorum)))))))))))));
END;
